{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Inc</strong> is an addictive <strong>incremental</strong> <strong>fishing</strong> game! Catch fish, earn cash, and unlock powerful skills. Master new ponds, fill your Fish Log with Legendary catches, and become the ultimate angler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch Fish!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel to many of the locations and catch all the fish in the areas! To catch fish you will need to click till you reach the goal target before you lose the fish!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/b6038575a3ce2ec7692773c1b7f52fc8.poster.avif?t=1774571215\" width=704 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/b6038575a3ce2ec7692773c1b7f52fc8.webm?t=1774571215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/b6038575a3ce2ec7692773c1b7f52fc8.mp4?t=1774571215\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Log Your Catches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time you will get better at catching certain species of fish, you will learn their tricks and it will let you catch bigger and higher quality fish! You will discover many fish species as you travel trough the fishing locations!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/3149320ed014c31c05dc069f033b4929.poster.avif?t=1774571215\" width=702 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126480/extras/3149320ed014c31c05dc069f033b4929.w